# Checksums for the gitignored mesh assets in obj/.
#
# These files are too large for git (shipwreck.obj alone is 275 MiB, past
# GitHub's 100 MB limit), so they are distributed out of band. This manifest
# is what makes that checkable: it records exactly which files a working
# checkout needs and what they should hash to.
#
# Verify with:   cd sim/world/data && sha256sum -c obj.sha256
# bootstrap.sh runs this automatically.
#
# texture/br2.png is tracked in git and so is not listed here.

8ea488fbcf91df8a27ebb2082031f15f7a12c869576dab369584df8ef7b81d9c  obj/bluerov2.obj
